# Allowlist: what service/Dockerfile reads, and what neocloud-api's image build
# takes from this repository as its `catalog` build context (the root module), so
# docs, charts, tests and tools never invalidate either build or its image tag.
*
!go.mod
!*.go
!runrecord
!snapshots
!adapters
!data
!service/go.mod
!service/go.sum
!service/cmd
!service/internal
!service/migrations
**/*_test.go
**/testdata
**/*.md
